{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 14 — Code quality: black, flake8, mypy\n","Objectives:\n","- Auto-format with black.\n","- Lint with flake8.\n","- Type-check with mypy.\n","Includes sample configs and commands."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Sample pyproject.toml\n","```toml\n","[tool.black]\n","line-length = 88\n","target-version = ['py310']\n","\n","[tool.flake8]\n","max-line-length = 88\n","extend-ignore = ['E203']\n","```\n","Run:\n","```bash\n","black .\n","flake8 .\n","mypy .\n","```\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Exercise\n","Apply black/flake8/mypy to your utilities from earlier days and fix issues."]}]}
